  <!-- Why so many $3 codes -->
  <h2>Why There Are So Many "$3 Off" Airalo Codes</h2>
  <p>
    Airalo runs a referral program called Airmoney: when someone signs up with your referral code and makes a first purchase, they get $3 off and you get $3 in Airmoney credit toward your own next eSIM. That's why the internet is full of individual people's personal "$3 off" codes rather than one single official promo &mdash; codes like BRIAN0890 above are exactly that, a real person's referral code, not a special deal negotiated with a publisher. It's a genuinely different mechanism from Holafly or Ubigi's affiliate-code setup, which is also why we don't have our own Airalo code the way we do for those providers.
  </p>

