  <div class="content-faq">
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>What is the best code right now</h3>
      <p><strong>NEWTOAIRALO15</strong> &mdash; 15% off your first Airalo eSIM. Already a customer? Use <strong>AIRALOESIM10</strong> for 10% off orders over $10.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>Does Airalo have unlimited plans</h3>
      <p>Yes, on a regional basis (Europe, Asia, North America, Latin America, the Caribbean, MENA, Africa, Australia). Full speed for the first 3GB each day, then throttled to 1Mbps until the daily allowance resets at midnight.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>Can I use hotspot on Airalo</h3>
      <p>Yes, hotspot tethering is supported on Airalo plans generally, and is unrestricted on the Unlimited regional eSIMs (subject to the same daily fair-use throttle as regular use).</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>Why does everyone have a different Airalo code</h3>
      <p>Airalo's referral program (Airmoney) gives every user their own personal $3-off code to share, rather than running one central affiliate discount. That's why you'll see many different codes instead of a single official one.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>Do Airalo eSIMs expire</h3>
      <p>The eSIM itself doesn't expire before activation, so you can buy ahead of a trip. Once activated, the plan's validity window (typically 7-30 days depending on the plan) starts counting down.</p>
